     <td><para unique="1046605">(AVX512_VNNI AND AVX512VL) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+601181"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046607">Multiply groups of 4 pairs of signed bytes in ymm3/m256/m32bcst with corresponding unsigned bytes of ymm2, summing those products and adding them to doubleword result in ymm1 under writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
